  "description": "Son Joong-gil, chairman of the Korea Finance Group, who represented Korea in the 1990s. 30 years after he closes his eyes, he opens them in the body of his grandson, Son Jeong-hoon, in 2022. A financial group that has declined noticeably compared to 30 years ago. Son Joong-gil is trying to bring the group he helped build to the top again.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
